# Git commits — no Cursor attribution

Never append any of these to commit messages (including inside HEREDOC bodies):

- `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>`
- `Co-authored-by: Cursor Agent <...>`
- `Made-with: Cursor`
- `Authored-by: Cursor <...>`

Human `Co-authored-by: Name <email>` trailers are allowed. This repo strips **Cursor-only** trailers via `.githooks` when `core.hooksPath` is `.githooks`; CI runs `npm run check:cursor-attribution`.
